                <pb facs="0865" n="857" sameAs="frus:frus1937v04/pg857"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.922/88: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Siam</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Neville</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-09-16T18:00:00-04:00">September 16, 1937—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. Note and two counterdrafts on treaty of friendship, commerce and navigation
                    presented to Siamese Minister September 14. Copies being forwarded air mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
